# Implementation Plan: Cross-Stitch Pattern Studio

## Phase 1: Foundation (Milestone 1)
- Project scaffolding (Vite + React + Tailwind).
- Basic UI layout (Canvas, Toolbar, Sidebar).
- DMC Color Palette integration (JSON data).

## Phase 2: Core Grid Editor (Milestone 2)
- High-performance grid rendering.
- Basic drawing tools (Pencil, Eraser, Fill).
- Color selection and "Recent Colors" list.

## Phase 3: Image-to-Chart Engine (Milestone 3)
- Image upload and downscaling logic.
- Color quantization and DMC mapping.
- Pattern preview and "Cleanup" tools.

## Phase 4: Export and Legends (Milestone 4)
- Symbol assignment algorithm.
- PDF generation (Chart + Legend).
- Thread usage estimation.

## Phase 5: Advanced Features
- 3D visualization and geometric panel support (Quaker Balls).
- Cloud sync / Project saving.
- Material inventory tracking.
